# Normalize text files in the repository so `git diff --check` reports real
# whitespace problems instead of line-ending noise.
#
# docs/tasks.csv is CRLF in both the working tree and history. Left alone, every
# line of it is flagged as "trailing whitespace" on any edit to the board, which
# trains you to ignore the one tool that would otherwise catch a stray space in
# a code file. `text=auto` fixes the diagnosis without rewriting history: the
# bytes on disk are untouched and existing diffs are unaffected.
* text=auto

# Generated build output and dependencies are never diffed.
node_modules/ -diff -mergebinary
dist/ -diff -mergebinary